+/// TransposeRowMajor is a transform that converts matrices with the `RowMajor` attribute
+/// to column major matrices. The access and types are updated as needed due to the
+/// transposition.
+/// @param module the module to transform
+/// @returns success or failure
+Result<SuccessType> TransposeRowMajor(core::ir::Module& module);
